- *October 2026.* Our new preprint "[https://doi.org/10.13140/RG.2.2.12741.00489 Hybrid Neural Network Training with Two-Dimensional Model-Based Subspace Search]", joint work with Churui Wang, is now available online.

- *October 2026.* Our new preprint "[https://doi.org/10.13140/RG.2.2.30422.61765 Subspace Trust Region Policy Optimization with a Direct Reduced Fisher Matrix]" is now available online.

