- *October 2026.* Our new preprint "[https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.24866 Random-subspace Ellipsoidal Trust-region Methods for Derivative-free Optimization]", joint work with Yiwen Chen, is now available on arXiv.

- *October 2026.* My poster "A New Hybrid Neural-Quadratic Model-Based Derivative-Free Optimization Method," joint work with Stefan M. Wild (Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory), has been accepted for [https://sites.google.com/ucdavis.edu/siamncc26/home SIAM NCC26] at UC Davis, October 26--27, 2026. I have also been awarded a SIAM NCC26 Travel Award.

- *September 2026.* My new preprint "[https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.17759 Derivative-Free Structured Updates for Muon]" is now available on arXiv.

- *September 2026.* I will give an invited seminar at Louisiana State University, Baton Rouge, Louisiana, on December 1, 2026. Tentative title: "A New Hybrid Neural-Quadratic Model-Based Derivative-Free Optimization Method".

- **August 2026.** Organizing two minisymposia for the [https://www.siam.org/conferences-events/siam-conferences/cse27/ SIAM Conference on Computational Science and Engineering (CSE27)], to be held on February 22--26, 2027, in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, USA: *Advances in Simulation-Based Optimization and Approximation Methods for Scientific Computing* and *Modern Optimization Methods Based on Approximation and Applications*.

- **June 2026.** Our paper "[https://doi.org/10.4208/jcm.2505-m2024-0276 An improved adaptive orthogonal basis method for multiple solutions of nonlinear elliptic equations in varying geometry]" has been selected for the "Editors' Choice" section of the Journal of Computational Mathematics.

- **June 2026.** Thanks to [https://wildsm.github.io/ Dr. Stefan M. Wild] for introducing our work on AI for derivative-free optimization (AI4DFO) in his [https://meetings.siam.org/sess/dsp_programsess.cfm?SESSIONCODE=88086 plenary talk] at the SIAM Conference on Optimization (OP26).

- **May 2026.** Welcomed Abdulaziz AlMuallim from UC Berkeley for undergraduate research on optimization and machine learning.

- **May 2026.** Started serving as a reviewer for [https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/ Mathematical\ Reviews\/MathSciNet] of the American Mathematical Society.

- **March 2026.** Co-organizing a minisymposium for the [https://www.siam.org/conferences-events/siam-conferences/mds26/ SIAM Conference on Mathematics of Data Science (MDS26)], to be held on November 16--20, 2026, in Salt Lake City, Utah, USA. The tentative minisymposium title is *Advances in Simulation-Based Optimization and Approximation Methods for Data Science*, co-organized with Kwassi Joseph Dzahini (Argonne National Laboratory).

- **Feb. 2026.** Congratulations to my mentee [https://thegreatanna.github.io/ Yitong He] on accepting an offer from Simon Fraser University. 

- **April 2025.** Appointed as Associate Editor for the journal Frontiers in Applied Mathematics and Statistics.




